OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with lengthy clear spells.
OL,7,FIt will stay dry overnight with mainly
OL,8,Fclear skies leading to some frost in
OL,9,Fplaces again and some fog patches
OL,10,Fdeveloping.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,13,Fmorning with an early frost in places.
OL,14,FClouding over from the southeast from
OL,15,Flate morning with the odd spot of
OL,16,Flight rain possible later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
